note Functions: zero, one and two inputs, give back, recursion

to dance
    show "dancing, no inputs needed"

to greet with name
    show "Hello, " + name

to add with a and b
    give back a + b

to factorial with n
    if n is at most 1 then
        give back 1
    give back n * factorial with n - 1

dance
greet with "Jesun"
show add with 2 and 3
show factorial with 5
show add with (add with 1 and 2) and 10
